{"_v":1,"id":"the-play-that-goes-wrong-west-end-2021","bd":{"positive":7,"mixed":1,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Marianka Swain","o":"The Telegraph","s":85,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.telegraph.co.uk/theatre/what-to-see/the-play-that-goes-wrong-duchess-theatre-review/","d":"2023-11-15","q":"Buy That Goes Wrong tickets in expectation of giant belly laughs, and you won’t be disappointed."},{"cn":"Fiona Mountford","o":"Evening Standard","s":74,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.standard.co.uk/go/london/theatre/the-play-that-goes-wrong-duchess-theatre-theatre-review-a3678186.html","d":"2014-09-15","q":"Yet, along with the rest of the enthusiastic audience, I laughed continually."},{"cn":"Kate Kellaway","o":"The Guardian","s":65,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/stage/2019/apr/28/all-my-sons-ghosts-the-play-that-goes-wrong-theatre-reviews","d":"2019-04-28","q":"Yet watching this tragedy evolve is like seeing a fragile object slip from a high ledge and being unable to interrupt its fall."},{"cn":"Dominic Maxwell","o":"The Times (UK)","s":42,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.thetimes.co.uk/article/the-play-that-goes-wrong-at-the-duchess-wc2-3pm9jhbhl5r","d":"2014-09-15","q":"Yet, for all the on-stage energy, for all the good wheezes in the script...it has a fatal lack of tension."},{"cn":"Sarah Hemming","o":"Financial Times","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.ft.com/content/a6ea33de-3cbc-11e4-9733-00144feabdc0","d":"2014-09-16","q":"That said, this is largely a joyous show."},{"cn":"The Stage","o":"The Stage","s":72,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.thestage.co.uk/reviews/2014/the-play-that-goes-wrong/","d":"2014-09-15","q":"It should leave you wanting more; this left me wanting a bit less."},{"cn":"Laura Barnett","o":"Time Out London","s":72,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/london/theatre/the-play-that-goes-wrong-1","d":"2014-09-15","q":"This comedy has, of course, actually done everything right."},{"cn":"Unknown",